cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "VoiceGuard: speech deepfake detection under phone-line conditions"
version: 0.5.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: MIT
abstract: "Frozen WavLM Base+ speech deepfake detectors trained on ASVspoof 2019 LA, evaluated under simulated phone-line, noise and Opus conditions and on the In-the-Wild dataset, with calibration (Cllr, minCllr), threshold-transfer and batch-padding analyses, a browser demo and a paper draft."
keywords:
  - speech deepfake detection
  - anti-spoofing
  - WavLM
  - calibration
  - telephony
repository-code: "https://github.com/MHKhan50/voiceguard-crosslingual-audio-deepfake-detection"
authors:
  - family-names: Hussain
    given-names: Muzammal
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-2570-5686"
